<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Ballin Like Curry (Official Audio by Iceyboylandon)</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Iceyboy Landon, Vincent2icey</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Ballin Like Curry (Official Audio by Iceyboylandon)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4jPY84KFAbjn0vLfUKFei0</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">40 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">BALLIN LIKE CURRY Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Intro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">CashMoneyAP</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">All my niggas ballin' like Curry</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ya bitch, mix that bitch like a McFlurry (Damn)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">All my chains icy, I'm lookin' furry (Ay)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hmm, your bitch yeah she is purdy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Purdy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nigga, hurry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ay)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I promise you, I'll pop you like I'm Curry (Ay)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, boy your diamonds glurry</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, sippin' on that dirty, damn</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Put up that 30 (damn)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Make yo ass fuckin' hurry (Talkin')</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I know yo ass ain't fucking talking pull out the Glock</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Grra, graa</p><p ttm:agent="v1">)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Atcha Glock bluh</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Damn</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Pull out that rocket, make yo ass fly</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Like by ha ha</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(beat restarts)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">All my niggas ballin' like Curry</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ya bitch, mix that bitch like a McFlurry (Damn)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">All my chains icy, I'm lookin' furry (Ay)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hmm, your bitch yeah she is purdy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Purdy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nigga, hurry (Ay)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I promise you, I'll pop you like I'm Curry (Ay)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, boy your diamonds glurry</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, sippin' on that dirty, damn[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">All the white kids ballin' like Jordan</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I’m the kitchen cooking like Gordon</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Outta prison just ask the warden</p><p ttm:agent="v1">On the court your net is what I score in</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I’m drippin' in swag, yeah I'm pourin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Got a bitch, no I don’t watch no porn</p><p ttm:agent="v1">In the lamb, in the fuckin foreign</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Yeah I'm in the gang, yeah I’m fuckin swornin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Do the dash in the whip, we fuckin' floor it</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I don’t need shooter cause we got white privilege</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Yeah we playing playing fuckin' cribbage</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Fuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1">your mom then I ask for forgiveness</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I fuck your sister, yeah I take an image</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Took a fat</p><p ttm:agent="v1">L</p><p ttm:agent="v1">and yeah we can see that, turn baby girl turn around</p><p ttm:agent="v1">we know that ass fat</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And</p><p ttm:agent="v1">your moms fat</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 3]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Irving, Texas yeah that's where I stay (Ay)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Look at my shooters cause they all rockin' chains (Schh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Don't get too comfortable we'll shoot you in your brain (Pow, pow, pow)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So much ice like I hit a lick on some chains</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You call that money boy I call that pocket change</p><p ttm:agent="v1">AK-40-Uzi same thing</p><p ttm:agent="v1">They both Cobain- shoot ya in yo brain (Ay)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">In the Rarri' with ya bitch, god dang (God dang)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Swervin' out the private plane (Rrrr, rrrr, ay)</p></div></body></tt>